{"unit_id":"544244857__dsh-image2-plugin#card-zh","repo":"544244857/dsh-image2-plugin","commit":"fc44d3feb4be5b7b4d0e0c20bd2b4d09c925dc1e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image2-tool 是面向 DSH 网页端的图片生成与编辑插件，通过注册 image2_generate 工具调用用户配置的 OpenAI 兼容图片中转服务。它支持根据文字生成图片，也能上传本地参考图进行图生图编辑，并可设置模型、尺寸、宽高比和输出文件名。生成结果支持 base64 或图片链接返回，保存到当前会话项目的指定目录，便于后续查看。插件还在 Plugins 页面提供中英文配置界面，用于管理中转地址、API Key 和生成选项，适合需要在 DSH 对话中制作或调整图片的用户。使用前需要配置可用的中转服务和 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:130-155","index.js:185-256","lib/client.js:462-472"]}
{"unit_id":"544244857__dsh-image2-plugin#card-en","repo":"544244857/dsh-image2-plugin","commit":"fc44d3feb4be5b7b4d0e0c20bd2b4d09c925dc1e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image2-tool adds prompt-based image generation and reference image editing to DSH through a configurable compatible relay. It saves returned images in the active project and offers model, size, aspect ratio, and output settings in the web Plugins page. A working relay and API key are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:130-155","index.js:185-256","lib/client.js:462-472"]}
